  "description": "Catalyst is a Natural Language Processing library built from scratch for speed. Inspired by spaCy's design, it brings pre-trained models, out-of-the box support for training word and document embeddings, and flexible entity recognition models. You can install language-specific models with the model packages Catalyst.Models.[Language], like: Catalyst.Models.English.",
